sequenceDiagram
  participant CLI
  participant Config
  participant Adoption as Migration adoption
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Diesel
  CLI->>Config: Load database URL and migration folder
  CLI->>Adoption: Verify Drizzle migration history
  Adoption->>DB: Compare expected history and baseline
  DB-->>Adoption: Existing migration state
  Adoption-->>CLI: Adoption report
  alt Adopt mode
    CLI->>Diesel: Apply pending Diesel migrations
    Diesel->>DB: Run migrations
    DB-->>Diesel: Applied versions
    Diesel-->>CLI: Migration result
  else Verify mode
    CLI-->>CLI: Skip migration writes
  end
